# .vercelignore — what Vercel must never upload from this tree.
#
# THIS REPO HAS NO DEPLOYABLE SURFACE. It is a plugin marketplace; nothing here
# is a web app. This file exists because on 2026-09-08 a `vercel --yes` was run
# against a worktree of this repo by accident, and the CLI deployed it anyway:
# with no framework detected Vercel set the output directory to "." and served
# the tree statically. `/.claude/settings.local.json` returned HTTP 200 to an
# unauthenticated curl while `/` returned 404.
#
# THE VERCEL CLI DOES NOT READ .gitignore. That is the whole defect. On that
# deploy, 423 tracked files AND 16 gitignored files were uploaded --
# .claude/settings.local.json, .claude/memory-sessions/*, and
# .claude/reports/telemetry-*.jsonl among them. Nothing warned; the failure is
# silent and after the fact.
#
# .vercelignore IS NOT .gitignore AGAIN. The two files answer different
# questions. .gitignore decides what is TRACKED. .vercelignore decides what is
# UPLOADED AND SERVED. Every file in this repo is tracked and none of it should
# ever be served, so "matches .gitignore" is a FLOOR and not the rule.
#
# In particular: this repo's .gitignore names individual .claude/ paths rather
# than the directory, because partial tracking under .claude/ is deliberate for
# git. No such reason applies here, so .claude/ is excluded wholesale. When in
# doubt between the narrow and the wide pattern, a deploy manifest takes the
# wide one -- the cost of over-excluding is a missing asset, and the cost of
# under-excluding is a public URL.
#
# Verified by: node plugins/autodev-core/scripts/check-deploy-target.js --ignore-file .

# --- session, agent and coordinator state. Machine-local by construction, and
# --- the reason the 2026-09-08 deploy became a disclosure rather than noise.
.claude/

# --- git internals. Uploading .git/ publishes every branch and every deleted
# --- file in the history, not just the working tree.
.git/
.github/

# --- dependencies and build output
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
.vercel/

# --- credentials
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# --- repo machinery. Never ships inside a plugin, never belongs on a host.
tooling/
docs/
scripts/

# --- local scratch and generated artefacts named by .gitignore
tmpclaude-*
*.log
.DS_Store
prd.json
prd-backup-*.json
prd-archive-*.json
handoff-*.md
ledger.json
settings.backup.json
*.vacuity-backup
